{"schema":2,"shard":1,"views":{"employees":"\n    <div class=\"grid g3\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Employee records</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"empRecordsCount\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Contract coverage</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"contractCoverage\">0%</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Asset acknowledgement</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"assetCoverage\">0%</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Employee register</h2>\n        <div id=\"employeeRegister\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Add employee record</h2>\n        <div class=\"stack\">\n          <div><label for=\"eName\">Employee name / reference</label><input id=\"eName\" placeholder=\"Employee name\"></div>\n          <div class=\"formgrid\">\n            <div><label for=\"eRole\">Role</label><input id=\"eRole\" placeholder=\"Job title\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"eStart\">Start date</label><input id=\"eStart\" type=\"date\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"eContract\">Contract signed?</label><select id=\"eContract\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"eAsset\">Asset acknowledgement?</label><select id=\"eAsset\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div>\n          </div>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"addEmployeeRecord()\">Add employee</button>\n          <div class=\"muted small\">Employee records are saved to this workspace and are used by reporting and employment controls. Enter only information needed for work administration; do not enter medical, banking or identity-document details here.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ","events":"\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Business event compliance</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted small\">Select what changed. The engine identifies compliance areas that should be re-checked.</div>\n      <div class=\"grid g3\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('premises')\"><b>Moved premises</b><div class=\"muted small\">Licence, zoning, lease, health inspection</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('ownership')\"><b>Ownership changed</b><div class=\"muted small\">CIPA, beneficial ownership, licences</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('activity')\"><b>New business activity</b><div class=\"muted small\">Trade/industrial licensing and reserved activities</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('hire')\"><b>Hiring employees</b><div class=\"muted small\">Contracts, payroll/PAYE, employee records</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('tax')\"><b>Tax status changed</b><div class=\"muted small\">VAT/PAYE/SAT configuration</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('manufacture')\"><b>Start manufacturing</b><div class=\"muted small\">Industrial licence, factory, environmental and reserved-activity checks</div></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"eventcard\" data-bw-onclick=\"runEvent('data')\"><b>New customer-data use</b><div class=\"muted small\">Privacy, access, retention, vendor controls</div></button>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"eventOutput\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"></div>\n    </div>\n  ","bwreadiness":"\n    <div class=\"between row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Botswana 2026/27 transition</div><h2>Business Readiness</h2><div class=\"muted\">Practical controls for regulatory changes that can affect a Botswana operating SME. Source conflicts fail closed: the workspace flags review instead of inventing a tax conclusion.</div></div><span class=\"badge info\">Source-governed</span></div>\n    <div class=\"bw-readiness-grid\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span id=\"bwCipaStatus\" class=\"readiness-status warn\">Set due month</span><h3>CIPA annual-return survival</h3><div id=\"bwCipaDetail\" class=\"muted small\">Set the company annual-return month.</div><div class=\"source-note\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Official CIPA guidance: P500 return; P500 penalty in the first 10 days after the due month; removal on day 11 if still unfiled; restoration P2,500.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status warn\">Threshold conflict</span><h3>VAT / PAYE registration thresholds</h3><p>BURS public pages currently conflict on threshold figures. Thebe Desk does not auto-trigger VAT/PAYE registration from those web thresholds. Confirm taxpayer status and use approved current tax tables / source-reviewed rules.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status good\">Effective 1 Jul 2026</span><h3>Tax reform readiness</h3><p>Prepare for the new tax framework, including eight-year tax record retention, remote/digital-services VAT considerations and the longer input-VAT claim window. Primary-source rule publication remains gated.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status warn\">Implementation watch</span><h3>Electronic VAT invoicing</h3><p>Botswana has established an electronic VAT invoicing framework. Track readiness, invoice-data quality and vendor capability; do not claim a live BURS integration until technical specifications and authorization are confirmed.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status good\">Effective 1 Sep 2026</span><h3>Employment-law transition</h3><p>The latest official ministerial statement sets 1 September 2026 for commencement of the Employment and Labour Relations Act 2025. Keep contracts, attendance, leave, disciplinary and grievance evidence current.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status warn\">Government implementation</span><h3>e-Procurement transition</h3><p>The Ministry of Finance is procuring an e-Government Procurement system. Thebe Desk focuses on registration/evidence/readiness and future transition controls—not duplicating free tender-discovery services.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status good\">Mobile-first</span><h3>Low-bandwidth operations</h3><p>Employee reporting is mobile-first. If connectivity fails, the entered report stays on the open page for retry; sensitive report text is not persisted in browser storage.</p></div>\n      <div class=\"bw-readiness-card\"><span class=\"readiness-status good\">Commercial control</span><h3>Plan boundaries</h3><p>Daily operations, location counts, AI allowances and linked-company access are plan-gated server-side. A hidden button cannot bypass subscription limits.</p></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><h2>Readiness checklist</h2><div id=\"bwReadinessChecklist\"></div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><h2>Why this matters commercially</h2><div class=\"commercial-note\"><b>Thebe Desk should not become another payroll or tender-feed app.</b><div class=\"small\" style=\"margin-top:5px\">Botswana already has locally priced payroll/HR products and a free tender-management option. The platform's differentiated value is continuous risk control, evidence, multi-location operations, labour defence, regulatory transition and management intelligence.</div></div><div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">Professional legal, tax or filing work remains separately quoted; subscription pricing covers software, monitoring and workflow—not unlimited professional advice.</div></div>\n    </div>\n  ","compliancepassport":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Passport score</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"passportScore\">0%</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Verified controls</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"passportVerified\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Total controls</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"passportTotal\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Active shares</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"passportShares\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Evidence-backed external proof</div><h2>Compliance controls</h2>\n      <div class=\"notice\"><b>Passport status is derived from assurance.</b><div class=\"small\">A control is not manually declared “verified”. Verification requires a current passing control with healthy evidence and evidence-backed/reviewed assurance.</div></div>\n      <div id=\"passportControlList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No controls available yet.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"passportReadOnlyNote\" style=\"display:none\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Read-only passport access</div>\n      <h2>Verified proof only</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted small\">Your role can review passport controls and assurance status. Creating, listing or revoking external share links is limited to the account owner or manager.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"passportSharingCard\">\n      <h2>Institutional sharing</h2>\n      <div class=\"muted small\">Select only the controls the recipient needs. Share links expire within 30 days, default to 25 views, are revocable, and become invalid after a material business/control change.</div>\n      <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n        <div><label for=\"passportShareLabel\">Share label</label><input id=\"passportShareLabel\" value=\"Compliance verification\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"passportMaxViews\">Maximum views</label><input id=\"passportMaxViews\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"1000\" value=\"25\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <label><input id=\"passportScopeScore\" type=\"checkbox\" checked aria-label=\"Passport scope score\"> Score</label>\n        <label><input id=\"passportScopeCompany\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Passport scope company\"> Company name</label>\n        <label><input id=\"passportScopeVerifiedAt\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Passport scope verified at\"> Verification date</label>\n      </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:12px\" data-bw-onclick=\"createPassportShare()\">Create secure share link</button>\n      <div id=\"passportShareCreated\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"></div>\n      <div id=\"passportShareList\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","licenceos":"\n  <div class=\"action-focus\">\n    <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Next licence action</div>\n    <h2 id=\"licenceNextTitle\">Review licence register</h2>\n    <div id=\"licenceNextDetail\" class=\"muted next-action-note\">Record the next authority-confirmed renewal or annual-fee date so the workspace can warn you before it is due.</div>\n    <div id=\"licenceNextActions\" class=\"actions\"></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g3\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Active</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"activeLicenceCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Due within 30 days</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"licenceRenewalsDue\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Expired / at risk</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"licenceAtRisk\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card progressive-register\">\n    <div class=\"between row\"><div><h2>Licence register</h2><div class=\"muted small\">One place for licences, registrations and authority-confirmed annual-fee dates.</div></div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"openLicenceEntry()\">Add licence</button></div>\n    <div id=\"licenceList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No licences yet.</div>\n  </div>\n  <details class=\"profile-details licence-entry-details\" id=\"licenceEntryDetails\">\n    <summary><span><b>Add a licence or registration</b><small>Record only authority-confirmed information. Dates can be added later if still unknown.</small></span></summary>\n    <div class=\"profile-details-body\">\n      <div class=\"formgrid\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <div><label for=\"newLicenceType\">Licence / registration type</label><input id=\"newLicenceType\" placeholder=\"Trade licence\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"newLicenceAuthority\">Authority</label><input id=\"newLicenceAuthority\" placeholder=\"Council / Ministry\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"newLicenceIssued\">Issued date</label><input id=\"newLicenceIssued\" type=\"date\"></div>\n        <div><label for=\"newLicenceRenewal\">Next renewal / annual-fee due</label><input id=\"newLicenceRenewal\" type=\"date\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actions\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"createLicence()\">Add to register</button><span id=\"licenceSaveStatus\" class=\"muted small\" role=\"status\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </details>\n","riskengine":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Open risk events</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"riskEventOpen\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Critical</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"riskEventCritical\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">High</div><div class=\"score warn\" id=\"riskEventHigh\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Risk pressure</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"riskPressure\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Compounding company history</div><h2>Business Risk Event Engine</h2></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"recalculateRiskEvents()\">Recalculate</button></div>\n    <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>Risk events are operational signals, not legal predictions.</b><div class=\"small\">Events are generated from explicit workspace facts such as overdue obligations, missing approved evidence, employment-control findings, expiring licences and tender gaps. Resolution history is retained so recurring weaknesses become visible over time.</div></div>\n    <div id=\"riskEventList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No risk events.</div>\n  </div>\n","statutorycalendar":"<div class=\"grid g4\"><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Upcoming statutory items</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"statCalUpcoming\">0</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Due in 30 days</div><div class=\"score warn\" id=\"statCal30\">0</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Needs setup</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"statCalNeeds\">0</div></div><div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Next due</div><div class=\"score\" style=\"font-size:22px\" id=\"statCalNext\">—</div></div></div><div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Authority-based dates</div><h2>Statutory Calendar</h2></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"recalculateStatutoryCalendar()\">Recalculate</button></div><div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>No guessed tax periods or licence dates.</b><div class=\"small\">PAYE, VAT, CIPA and annual-fee schedules are generated only from published rules plus recorded company facts. VAT Category A/B/C must match the BURS-assigned category. Trade/industrial annual-fee dates must be confirmed from the relevant licence or portal.</div></div><h3 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Upcoming</h3><div id=\"statCalendarList\" class=\"muted small\">No generated statutory dates.</div><h3 style=\"margin-top:16px\">Setup required</h3><div id=\"statCalendarSetup\" class=\"muted small\">No setup gaps.</div></div>","profile":"\n    <div class=\"card profile-card\">\n      <div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Business setup</div>\n      <h2>Business details</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted profile-intro\">Keep the facts that drive your workspace here. Tax periods, CIPA records and licence dates live in their dedicated tools so you only see them when they matter.</p>\n      <div id=\"profileReadiness\" class=\"profile-readiness\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"profile-section\">\n        <div class=\"profile-section-head\"><div><h3>Core business</h3><p class=\"muted small\">The minimum facts used to match obligations and recommendations.</p></div><span class=\"badge good\">Core</span></div>\n        <div class=\"formgrid\">\n          <div><label for=\"pName\">Company / business name</label><input id=\"pName\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pEntityType\">Legal entity type</label><select id=\"pEntityType\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"\">Select</option><option value=\"company\">Company</option><option value=\"business_name\">Business name</option><option value=\"sole_trader\">Sole trader</option><option value=\"partnership\">Partnership</option><option value=\"other\">Other</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pIndustry\">Industry</label><select id=\"pIndustry\"><option>Retail</option><option>Construction</option><option>Restaurant / Takeaway</option><option>Guesthouse / Hospitality</option><option>Professional Services</option><option>Manufacturing</option><option>Cleaning Services</option><option>Funeral / Memorial Services</option><option>Transport</option><option>Other</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pTown\">Town / District</label><input id=\"pTown\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pEmployees\">Number of employees</label><input id=\"pEmployees\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"profile-section\">\n        <div class=\"profile-section-head\"><div><h3>What applies to this business?</h3><p class=\"muted small\">Answer the current position. The workspace will surface the detailed tool only when relevant.</p></div></div>\n        <div class=\"formgrid profile-applicability-grid\">\n          <div><label for=\"pVat\">VAT registration status</label><select id=\"pVat\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"unknown\">Not confirmed</option><option value=\"true\">Registered</option><option value=\"false\">Confirmed not registered</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pPaye\">PAYE registration status</label><select id=\"pPaye\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"unknown\">Not confirmed</option><option value=\"true\">Registered / active</option><option value=\"false\">Confirmed not registered</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pTrade\">Trade / business licence status</label><select id=\"pTrade\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"unknown\">Not confirmed</option><option value=\"true\">Licence / registration held or tracked</option><option value=\"false\">Confirmed none currently tracked</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pData\">Processes customer personal data?</label><select id=\"pData\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pTender\">Tenders for contracts?</label><select id=\"pTender\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pPremises\">Business premises?</label><select id=\"pPremises\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No</option></select></div>\n          <div><label for=\"pManufacturing\">Manufacturing enterprise?</label><select id=\"pManufacturing\" data-bw-onchange=\"syncProfileProgressiveFields()\"><option value=\"false\">No</option><option value=\"true\">Yes</option></select></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <details class=\"profile-details\" id=\"profileOptionalDetails\">\n        <summary><span><b>Optional business context</b><small>Add only when it improves a rule, licence route or tender recommendation.</small></span></summary>\n        <div class=\"profile-details-body\">\n          <div class=\"formgrid\">\n            <div><label for=\"pIncorporationDate\">Incorporation / registration date</label><input id=\"pIncorporationDate\" type=\"date\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"pCitizenOwned\">Citizen-owned?</label><select id=\"pCitizenOwned\"><option value=\"true\">Yes</option><option value=\"false\">No / mixed</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"pTurnover\">Annual turnover (P)</label><input id=\"pTurnover\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"1000\" placeholder=\"Optional unless a route depends on turnover\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>Tax guardrail:</b> Annual turnover is never substituted for VAT taxable supplies. Use taxable supplies, not total turnover, in Tax details when that fact is required.</div>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <div class=\"profile-section profile-next-section\">\n        <div class=\"profile-section-head\"><div><h3>Relevant detailed setup</h3><p class=\"muted small\">Open only the records that apply. These tools hold the detailed dates and identifiers.</p></div></div>\n        <div id=\"profileRelevantTools\" class=\"profile-tool-grid\"></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"profile-persistence-fields\" hidden aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <input id=\"pVatCategory\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pTradeAnniversary\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pCipaMonth\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pCipaUin\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pCipaStatus\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pRegisteredOffice\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pAnnualTaxableSupplies\" type=\"hidden\"><input id=\"pHighestMonthlyEmployeePay\" type=\"hidden\">\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"actions profile-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"saveProfile()\">Save changes</button><button type=\"button\" id=\"profileResetDemo\" class=\"btn alt profile-preview-reset\" data-bw-onclick=\"resetDemo()\">Reset preview data</button><span id=\"profileSaveStatus\" class=\"muted small\" role=\"status\"></span></div>\n    </div>\n  "}}